---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import StructuredData from '../components/StructuredData.astro'
import CompanyShowcase from '../components/CompanyShowcase.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About | Start & Scale"
	description="Operating partners who've done the work, not studied it. Our advisors have operated at every stage, from pre-revenue to over $1B in ARR."
	canonical="/about"
>
	<StructuredData type="organization" />

	<!-- Hero -->
			<section class="bg-dark pt-32 pb-16 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-28">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<h1 class="font-display text-white text-h1 lg:text-[3.75rem] lg:leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl">
						We've built companies that most people read about.
					</h1>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body-light mt-6 max-w-2xl">
						Start & Scale is an operating partner that meets founders and leadership teams where they are. Our advisors have launched markets, closed $100M+ in enterprise deals, built teams from zero, and kept execution moving across orgs that didn't report to them. Now we do that work alongside our clients.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Track Record -->
			<section class="bg-background pt-12 sm:pt-16 lg:pt-20" aria-labelledby="track-record-heading">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 pb-12 sm:pb-16 lg:pb-20">
					<h2 id="track-record-heading" class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Our track record</h2>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-4 max-w-3xl">Startups, nonprofits, and Fortune 50 companies all run into the same problem: the business moves faster than its systems. Our advisors have seen it from every side, building and scaling founder-led organizations and operating inside some of the world's most valuable companies. We partner with founders and leadership teams to diagnose what's holding the business back, co-create the strategy and tactics, and translate the plan into measurable growth.</p>
				</div>
				<CompanyShowcase />
			</section>

			<!-- Why Work With Me -->
			<section class="bg-surface py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Why work with us</h2>

					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mt-10">
						<!-- Differentiator 1 -->
						<div class="bg-background p-6 lg:p-8 rounded">
							<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4">We've operated inside hypergrowth, not studied it.</h3>
							<p class="text-body text-body mt-4">
								Most consultants know hypergrowth from case studies. We know it from the org chart that changed monthly, the systems that broke under load, and the timelines that got cut in half on a Thursday. Our advisors have operated at every stage, from pre-revenue to over $1B in ARR. We know what breaks at each one, and what to build before it does.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Differentiator 2 -->
						<div class="bg-background p-6 lg:p-8 rounded">
							<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4">We lead across functions without direct authority.</h3>
							<p class="text-body text-body mt-4">
								Same pattern at every engagement: walk into a cross-functional problem across sales, marketing, ops, and CS. Impose clarity. Drive accountability. Keep execution moving, usually with teams that don't report to us. Founders need this constantly and struggle to hire for it.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Differentiator 3 -->
						<div class="bg-background p-6 lg:p-8 rounded">
							<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4">We write the story your team can tell.</h3>
							<p class="text-body text-body mt-4">
								Positioning usually gets written in a conference room and rarely survives the first sales call. Ours starts in front of the people you need to convince, whether that's a buyer, a donor or a board. We listen for what lands, cut what stalls, and hand your team language they'll actually use.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Differentiator 4 -->
						<div class="bg-background p-6 lg:p-8 rounded">
							<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4">We build the technology ourselves.</h3>
							<p class="text-body text-body mt-4">
								We built a full-stack SaaS platform end-to-end: React, TypeScript, Supabase, 19 Edge Functions, AI document processing. We configure Salesforce, deploy marketing automation, and ship production code. When we recommend a system, we can implement it. No handoff to another vendor. No six-month integration project.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CTA Block -->
			<section class="bg-dark py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
					<h2 class="font-display text-white text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Curious whether we'd be a fit?</h2>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body-light mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">30 minutes. No pitch, no deck. Just a conversation about where you are and what might move the needle.</p>
					<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 items-center">
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-accent-hover text-white text-btn px-7 py-3.5 rounded hover:brightness-90 transition duration-150 cursor-pointer inline-block">
							Book a Call
						</a>
						<a href="/contact" class="text-body-light text-btn hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer inline-block py-3.5">
							Or send a message &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
</BaseLayout>
